Package: MimeSys
Title: Template-Based Multi-Omics Simulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2025-04-12
Author: Himel Mallick <himel.mallick@merck.com>
Maintainer: Himel Mallick <himel.mallick@merck.com>
Description: MimeSys simulates multi-omics datasets from fitted real-data templates, preserving marginal distributions and within- and cross-view dependence while adding controllable aligned signal and continuous, binary, or survival outcomes for simulation studies.
